// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/widgets/t27-cell.t27 -- 27 seats against 16: a 3-trit T27 cell beside a 4-bit E2M1 (FP4) code
; Source of truth for public/widgets/t27-cell/ (gHashTag/trinity, apps/website). The page is written
; by scripts/widget-pages-from-spec.mjs from this file; tool.js holds no English of its own and reads
; every word below from window.T27_WIDGET, and every level and storage number from ./data.json.
; ASCII only (L3), English only (LANG-EN).

; WHAT IT DRAWS: one number line from -1 to 1 (the top seat of either format is 1, which is what a
; power-of-two block scale under the block_tnf rule, rule B, gives both of them), with the 27 levels
; of T27_N above it and the 15 distinct values of E2M1 below it. The reader drags along the line,
; moves a slider or types a weight; the page shows the seat each format rounds it to (nearest seat, a
; tie to the smaller magnitude, as the runner rounds), the code of that seat (three trits, or four
; bits) and the error. Under it, the storage of 32 weights in trits and in bits for T27, MXFP4, MX+,
; NVFP4 and E2M2, with each one's measured test perplexity.

; WHERE THE NUMBERS COME FROM: scripts/widget-data/t27-cell.mjs compiles the two pre-registrations in
; trinity-fpga, specs/numeric/ternary_storage_search.t27 and ternary_storage_search_v2.t27, with the
; t27 compiler (public/t27/t27_compiler.wasm), runs their own test blocks, checks the tables the two
; share are identical, recomputes T27_N from its stated recipe (the NF4 normal-quantile rule at 27
; levels) with python statistics.NormalDist, reads the per-tensor NVFP4 scale from the v2 storage
; line, reads the measured perplexities from research/block/ternary_storage_search_v2.json after
; checking that its spec sha256 is the v2 file's, and writes public/widgets/t27-cell/data.json with
; the commit of every file. It then checks every K_ fact below against that data; a spec that
; disagrees fails the run. scripts/widget-data/t27-cell-card.py draws card.png from data.json.

; WHAT IT DOES NOT CLAIM: anything about binary memory, where T27 costs more bits than NVFP4; the cost
; of a trit cell against a bit cell, which nobody has measured; other models, corpora, activations or
; the KV cache. The quality column is one 135M model, 40 windows, weights only, no uncertainty
; interval; MX+ and NVFP4 are re-implementations; T27_N was chosen on dev from three candidates. The
; number line uses the MXFP4 scale rule for E2M1; NVFP4 puts the same 15 values under a finer
; per-16 scale, which the line does not draw.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

